{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"12a9ed89f6e5e8a0400b288bd1cf8f7e2fd06b64360a4dde6694e30807731b8d","ja":"まつりん、打ち合わせお疲れ様～！\n今度のアイドル運動会、同じチームで頑張ろうね♪","zh":"茉莉，开会辛苦啦～！\n下次的偶像运动会，我们要分在同一个队伍里一起加油哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"50f7746d932241b341b0c7865fbcd459f1fa96f5aa7f3738321edcf60702a270","ja":"はいなのです！\n一緒に優勝目指して頑張りましょー！","zh":"好的！一起努力夺冠吧——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"69ee9f4166fce6f1efae59a4d081bf43799de822f061696f04eb980621b0c3f6","ja":"てててててててて、てててててててーん♪\nてててててててて、てててててててて♪","zh":"哒哒哒哒哒哒哒哒、哒哒哒哒哒哒哒～♪\n哒哒哒哒哒哒哒哒、哒哒哒哒哒哒哒哒♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b6738d87e75b196e1681df7d8d3a0c40f59f5e967148f3323c0daf0e6e96fb24","ja":"あっ、電話だ！　ちょっとごめんね！\n……もしもーし。","zh":"啊，来电话了！稍等一下！\n……喂喂。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bfac8de223c7942d3558dac8438e60d3474e400c84b85fca018e2ad9aa6f4e46","ja":"うん！　ちょうど打ち合わせ終わったとこ！\nそれじゃあ、またあとでね～。","zh":"嗯！正好刚开完会！\n那待会儿再见啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cbe3ce51262a891a4e751d571241431041b90acd2569c97818d8d4ff5a9616de","ja":"海美ちゃん、今の着メロって、\n運動会でよく聞く曲ですよね？","zh":"海美，刚才那个手机铃声，\n是运动会上经常能听到的曲子吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1b3fdb68ac5be45804d8a8f6505336b7467a052a5c0e18de7d0905de7fd236ac","ja":"そうなの！　この前の公演衣装って\nフレンチカンカンのイメージでしょ？","zh":"对啊！之前那套演出服装\n是法国康康舞的风格吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7db6fb53c22d1854d7d440633fcce49a90cfadc91cf51e4918a7b02899ef8bee","ja":"それで有名な曲の一つがこの曲なんだって！\n『天国と地獄』っていうらしいよっ。","zh":"其中很有名的一首曲子就是这一首！\n好像是叫《天国与地狱》哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"bd960199866f41d443c9fbe32c7902b66bb43c989d3cc398336e7633a283611f","ja":"海美ちゃん、そこまで調べたのですね。\nえらいのです♪","zh":"海美，居然调查到这一步了呀。\n真了不起呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"86786264dc281885b7589616772c1f124ef4c19c7476ad45bc854f05254bb66c","ja":"えへへー。ありがとっ！","zh":"嘿嘿～谢谢啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"77d0bd6ebb29ceea1fa597b00b8455791596283b9a340ad0c6cea942e0363397","ja":"この曲って、聞いてるとテンション上がるよね？\nだから着メロに使ってるんだ！","zh":"这首歌听着就让人情绪高涨对吧？\n所以我拿来当铃声了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7d549b7b0908e8c13f091a5811f5af9a1677c83c5bb7c9fb511edea42efb4e2c","ja":"姫も、聞いてるとなんだか\n体を動かしたくなるのです。","zh":"公主听着听着，\n也总觉得身体想动起来了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c49962efc91b156623ed003bf5ac0ef80f319d74f3bef5153768af4e0a4b9425","ja":"だよね！　そうだ！　今度、運動会の練習しない？\n一緒に二人三脚に出るんだし！","zh":"就是说嘛！对了！下次要不要练习运动会的内容？\n毕竟我们还要一起参加两人三足呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1412.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0cf617e2ce00ab25906fb68b3852d51e91aa4c2ccbdfb6caf8d90808870490fe","ja":"もちろんなのです！\n本番に向けて特訓するのですよ！","zh":"当然啦！\n要为正式演出加紧特训哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
